# .astro components are handled by `astro check`/eslint, not prettier
# (no prettier-plugin-astro installed).
*.astro
# The documentation content is table-formatted by the repo's own
# cmd/format_md_tables (CI-gated), whose centered-cell padding prettier
# would flatten; markdownlint owns the rest of the markdown there. Keeping
# both authorities on the same files made each formatter dirty the other.
src/content/docs/**/*.mdx
# The benchmark record is written by cmd/bench_resources with encoding/json's
# indentation and checked against the rendered pages by `-check`; prettier
# would collapse its short numeric arrays and make the generator's own output
# fail the lint it cannot satisfy.
src/data/resource-benchmark.json
